Axioma composes and adapts work from several upstream projects.

The Axioma-specific source in this repository is GPL-3.0-only.

Notable upstream projects:

- Fedora COSMIC Atomic and Fedora packages: various Fedora-compatible licenses.
- Universal Blue image-template and Bazzite: Apache-2.0.
- Universal Blue akmods: Apache-2.0.
- cosmic-ext-extra-sessions and cosmic-ext-alternative-startup: GPL-3.0.
- COSMIC session and greeter: GPL-3.0.
- niri: GPL-3.0.
- DankMaterialShell: multiple licenses; see the upstream distribution.
- Quickshell: LGPL-3.0-or-later and bundled component licenses.
- Vicinae: GPL-3.0.

Source locations and exact revisions are recorded in build/versions.env and
the OCI image labels. Files copied or adapted from upstream retain their SPDX
headers where present.

